Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.01,0:00:29.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:39.14,0:00:40.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tare!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.40,0:00:44.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredibil!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Parcă ar fi o persoană reală.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:56.58,0:00:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ubu, tu l-ai făcut?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:03.71,0:01:07.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Copiii se înțeleg și nu \Navem cazuri de hărțuire.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta e unul dintre \Ncele mai bune centre.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.97,0:01:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sper că vor ajunge cu \Ntoții să fie adoptați.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.05,0:01:17.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Priviți, domnule director.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E incredibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.02,0:01:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să devii un mecanic \NSomadea când vei crește?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, vreau să devin inginer.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:24.36,0:01:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.84,0:01:53.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-am găsit!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.60,0:01:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bum.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-am găsit, domnule director.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.78,0:02:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai găsit un loc bun unde să te ascunzi. \NEști destul de deștept.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule director, \Ncine sunt acești oameni?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.54,0:02:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba... Credeți că mă puteți omorî?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.18,0:02:35.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-e frică!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O mitralieră Luger de 9 mm nu are \Nniciun efect asupra unui corp Somadea.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.20,0:02:56.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Termină cu joaca, Maggie!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.70,0:02:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:03.58,0:03:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă poți învinge cu \Njalnica ta modificare ilegală.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:09.04,0:03:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Puștoaică nemernică de la Arhimoarte...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.09,0:03:16.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești praf, moșule.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.69,0:03:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Câtă cruzime...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Singura persoană \Ncrudă era acel bărbat.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.66,0:03:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.37,0:03:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,El v-a omorât părinții și \Nv-a adus la orfelinatul său.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.66,0:03:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Era un adevărat monstru care cerea taxe imense \Nde admitere pentru a-și finanța viața lui luxoasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Minți.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.00,0:03:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ne-a fost deloc ușor să-l găsim după ce și-a \Nschimbat identitatea cu ajutorul operațiilor estetice.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:01.51,0:04:04.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.52,0:04:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu și Maggie suntem vânători de \Nrecompense de la compania Arhimoarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.06,0:04:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am venit aici pentru a ne ocupa de un criminal \Ncăutat ce are modificări Somadea ilegale.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești destul de drăguță.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum te cheamă?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:20.45,0:04:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil ai în jur de 14 ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.12,0:04:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acest centru se va închide curând. \NAi vrea să vii cu mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.08,0:04:36.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, iar iese pedofilul din tine, \Nșefule. Eu mă retrag.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce fețe oribile.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei sunt țintele noastre următoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.52,0:05:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și ei au modificări ilegale, \Nașa că nu-ți lăsa garda jos.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.03,0:05:41.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt doar niște criminali proști, \Ndeci va fi floare la ureche.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.45,0:05:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-i lăsa să te zgârie.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:45.24,0:05:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar ești păpușica mea drăguță.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai să-i prindem înaintea celorlalte companii.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.75,0:05:55.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem cu Toraichi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.96,0:05:59.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Du-te și ia-ți Minimi-ul. \NȘi nu-ți uita căscuța.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.51,0:06:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am înțeles, șefule.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun! Vin să vă omor!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deschide depozitul de arme!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-aș dori să te pot întâlni \Ndin nou sub această înfățișare.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,V-ați decis?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Le vreau pe toate.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.03,0:06:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom lua bani frumoși pe aceste fete.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă vom duce într-un \Nloc nou și foarte drăguț.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.67,0:06:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur, stăpâne.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.76,0:06:47.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vei face mentenanță la toate?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.14,0:06:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crezi că marfa defectă se vinde?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba faci acolo? \NGrăbește-te și urcă odată!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.77,0:06:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Târfulița aia e...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.52,0:06:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Micuța Maggie...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:56.94,0:06:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,de la Arhimoarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:01.69,0:07:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Termină cu joaca!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.03,0:07:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mori, târfulițo!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:13.91,0:07:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ea din nou?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.13,0:07:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nemernico!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar vrei să-mi furi prada?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te dai mare pentru că \Nîncă ai corp uman?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în mijlocul unei lupte acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.07,0:07:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar tu ești degeaba, așa că dispari!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te fac zdrențe!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu urmezi acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.33,0:08:38.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vânează în altă parte, \Nvânătoareo de recompense!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.83,0:08:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vom fi împușcați din cauza ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar nimeni nu a fost împușcat
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și vă mai și scap de gunoaie de aici,
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că nu vă mai plângeți dacă nu \Nvreți să vă trag un glonț în cap!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.17,0:08:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine spus.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.93,0:08:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maggie.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.43,0:08:53.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești în viață, Maggie?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asta ți-am tot spus.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.48,0:09:01.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creierul tău nu e artificial,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.69,0:09:05.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că dacă e distrus, \Nnu te voi mai putea aduce înapoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.98,0:09:08.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar dacă ești împușcată cu \Ngloanțe de tip Figure Killer,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.99,0:09:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nici măcar un corp Somadea \Ncomplet nu te-ar salva.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.99,0:09:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Presupun că diseară voi face un grătar \Ncomemorativ și mă voi gândi la ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acel individ...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.02,0:09:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.03,0:09:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că ai făcut și de data \Nasta o mulțime de distrugeri.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.86,0:09:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar guvernul se va asigura că \Nvictimele vor fi despăgubite.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sistemul de justiție e prea blând cu voi,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,vânătorii de recompense.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta pentru că voi nu-i puteți prinde \Npe criminalii cu modificări Somadea.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.88,0:10:08.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau mă înșel?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-a făcut plăcere să facem afaceri.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă te crezi atât de \Nbună la ceea ce faci,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.52,0:10:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,de ce nu ajuți societatea \Neliminând gruparea Tepeshracula?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.15,0:10:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt vreun erou.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.95,0:10:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sper să ai parte de o \Nviață lungă, Kamigori Ubu.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.29,0:11:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scârbos...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.00,0:11:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine-i acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.62,0:11:28.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt eu, domnul Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.38,0:11:29.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eleganță...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.59,0:11:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E periculos să rămâi aici. \NAr trebui să-ți găsești alt loc.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.21,0:11:35.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce tot spui acolo? \NTocmai ce l-am prins pe intrus.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:35.72,0:11:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi făceam griji pentru tine, \Nașa că mi-am permis să intru neinvitat.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce sunt chestiile astea?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.72,0:11:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am idee. Și eu le \Nvăd pentru prima oară.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu nu aș fi capabil \Nde un asemenea truc.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.27,0:11:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci cine e responsabil?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.77,0:11:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți place viața pe \Ncare o ai acum, Ubu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.44,0:11:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta nu e treaba ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.53,0:11:59.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți cheltuiești banii pătați de sânge \Npe nevoile zilnice și pe unelte.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau ceva de genul.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.28,0:12:03.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barba ta e așa de dezgustătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.04,0:12:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai face bine să pleci dacă \Nnu vrei să te las fără ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.66,0:12:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, asta? E doar un tatuaj.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.67,0:12:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuzant.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am mai întâlnit o femeie ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.63,0:12:15.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai vrea să te alături companiei Arhimoarte?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.63,0:12:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Răspunsul meu va fi mereu „nu”, \Nindiferent de câte ori mă întrebi.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă nu vei deveni a mea,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,atunci te voi face chiar \Ndacă va trebui să te omor.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.06,0:12:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-ai pierdut mințile.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu voi lăsa pe nimeni să te aibă.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.10,0:12:30.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ieși afară.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.73,0:12:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să te mai văd vreodată...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e dovada iubirii mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.28,0:12:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atât de mult te iubesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.42,0:12:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în viață.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.94,0:13:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce se petrece?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.11,0:13:23.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.42,0:13:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta nu e piciorul meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am cerut niciodată \Nun implant Somadea!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar vei putea juca baseball din nou.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.97,0:13:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.55,0:13:43.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oprește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu simt niciun pic de durere.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.14,0:13:49.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnișoară Kamigori.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai trezit.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.39,0:13:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mecanismul cerebral încă nu \Ns-a sincronizat cu noul corp,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.27,0:13:56.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,așa că ai nevoie de odihnă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.03,0:13:59.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cât timp...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dormit un an de zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți voi suna tutorele chiar acum, \Ndeci te rog să te întorci...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:06.74,0:14:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tutore?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.33,0:14:10.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă refer la domnul Eleganță!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.54,0:14:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acel nenorocit nu e tutorele meu!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.09,0:14:16.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.42,0:14:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acel gunoi...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}E un criminal!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.93,0:14:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun-venit.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.18,0:14:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.68,0:14:29.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi împrumuta asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lama cuțitului nu mă taie.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu simt durere. \NȘi nici nu curge sânge.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.66,0:14:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-l poți da înapoi acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.83,0:14:52.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un Somadea... \NNu m-am așteptat la asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eleganță!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.38,0:15:01.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Îmi simt corpul... foarte greu...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-am prins.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.86,0:15:30.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Procedura medicală actuală pentru un corp \NSomadea e o adevărată inovație revoluționară.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salutare.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te omor!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:42.92,0:15:45.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai ai puterea de acum un an.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.97,0:15:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-am redus abilitățile fizice \Nla cele ale unei fetițe de 14 ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.64,0:15:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba mi-ai făcut?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.18,0:15:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e ispășirea păcatelor mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:53.06,0:16:00.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mai amintești cum l-am eliminat acum 11 ani pe acel director dubios de la orfelinat și ți-am distrus viața?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.15,0:16:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că-ți ofer șansa s-o iei de la capăt.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu are niciun sens.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creierul tău e singura bucată de \Ncarne rămasă din corpul tău real.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:06.49,0:16:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai un corp Somadea acum. \NEști o păpușă mecanică.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:09.95,0:16:13.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vei începe o viață nouă \Nde la vârsta de 14 ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca păpușa mea mică și adorabilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:17.46,0:16:20.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci de asta m-ai omorât.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.38,0:16:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te-am omorât.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.04,0:16:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-am evitat organele \Nvitale ca să nu mori instant.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ba nu! M-ai omorât!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.31,0:16:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Durerea, mirosul și gustul \Nnu pot fi recreate artificial.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu simți niciun fel de atingere, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:45.44,0:16:48.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești curioasă de asta? \NOchiul meu stâng e o cameră.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.65,0:16:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În rest, sunt complet carne și oase.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.95,0:16:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te voi ierta niciodată!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.99,0:16:56.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, nu ai unde să \Nmergi chiar dacă ai pleca.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.75,0:16:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am ocupat deja de \Neliberarea apartamentului tău,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.79,0:17:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar toate economiile tale au \Nfost transferate în contul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.00,0:17:09.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și, desigur, am avut grijă \Nși de corpul tău real.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.72,0:17:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Instanța te-a declarat deja dispărută, știi?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poliția chiar e inutilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.52,0:17:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu ajutorul GPS-ului te pot găsi oriunde.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.69,0:17:23.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iar cu o singură apăsare de buton, \Nîți pot opri corpul actual.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.44,0:17:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am personalizat acest dispozitiv \Nspecial pentru tine, mica mea Cherry.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:31.24,0:17:32.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nenorocitule...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.91,0:17:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai fost deloc atentă \Nla ce am spus, Cherry?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:48.21,0:17:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salutare!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce sunt dezbrăcată?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.01,0:17:58.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai dormit un an de zile. \NAi nevoie de o baie.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.60,0:17:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e acest loc?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.89,0:18:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Biranoyu. Chiar și holul pe care eram \Nmai devreme aparține de această locație.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:03.27,0:18:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E o stațiune de băi \Ntermale pe care o administrez.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.40,0:18:11.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și un paravan unde \Nmă ascund de criminali.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Văd că nu te înveți deloc minte.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:28.34,0:18:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar fi mai bine să te potolești, Cherry.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta e biroul companiei Arhimoarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.09,0:18:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Începând de azi, vei lucra pentru \Nmine și vei locui aici, în Biranoyu.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.35,0:18:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine ar vrea să lucreze \Nîntr-un loc ca acesta...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu prea ai de ales, păpușica mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.23,0:18:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești un pervers dezgustător!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.69,0:18:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi lua asta ca pe un compliment.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:58.45,0:19:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e camera ta. \NO poți decora după cum dorești.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uneltele din bagajul \Ntău se află în depozit.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.16,0:19:08.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Îți jur că nu voi lăsa \Nlucrurile astfel, Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.13,0:19:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-am reperat pe criminalul \Ncăutat, Tommy J.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.63,0:19:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Repede, să fugim!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.80,0:19:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem nevoie de întăriri! Imediat!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aruncă arma și predă-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:27.48,0:19:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.94,0:19:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poliția chiar e inutilă.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, gunoaielor, ați văzut asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ajutor... Cineva...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:37.95,0:19:38.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vrem să murim.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:40.91,0:19:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dispăreți. Nu-mi place \Nsă împușc bătrâni și copii.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.03,0:20:21.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E mult mai palpitant \Nsă-i arunc în aer!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.33,0:20:32.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când am adormit?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.22,0:20:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am un corp Somadea,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:40.09,0:20:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar creierul meu are nevoie \Nîn continuare de odihnă.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bănuiesc că e normal. \NDoar e făcut din țesut uman.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.90,0:20:55.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când a...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.40,0:21:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Draga mea Cherry, astea sunt hărțile \Nde la Biranoyu și Arhimoarte.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.16,0:21:05.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Învață-le repede. Abia aștept \Nsă lucrez cu tine, dl Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.50,0:21:18.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Estetica camerei și \Nhainele sunt dezgustătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.09,0:21:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tommy J.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.34,0:21:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un criminal în serie care omoară, în special, femei, copii și bătrâni.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.02,0:21:29.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce nenorocit.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.56,0:21:31.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Du-te cu Vespa.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că Tommy J se \Nîndreaptă spre alt oraș.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.82,0:21:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi vâna de unul singur.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În schimb, vreau un procent \Nmai mare din recompensă.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.15,0:21:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bărbații primesc două procente. \NDacă nu-ți convine, poți merge în altă parte.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:49.04,0:21:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tommy J și-a întărit\Npielea părților modificate.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folosește gloanțe Figure Killer.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.84,0:22:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu deja. Nu mă mai freca la icre.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.22,0:22:02.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Tu cine mai ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine naiba e fata asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:12.60,0:22:14.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt uneltele mele?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:14.35,0:22:17.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ea e noua angajată și va locui aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:18.15,0:22:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kamigori Ubu, 14 ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:20.94,0:22:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Văd că ai rămas la fel de dubios...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:23.78,0:22:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce procent primesc fetele?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Și tu ești un vânător?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.29,0:22:31.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cincizeci la sută. De ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:31.83,0:22:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să lucrezi pentru un nemernic ca el? \NȚi-ai pierdut mințile?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.92,0:22:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să fac ceea ce spune Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.75,0:22:42.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am întrebat unde-mi sunt uneltele.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.05,0:22:46.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Pe bune?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.80,0:22:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Văd că nu ești deloc o începătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.89,0:22:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba se petrece aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:50.64,0:22:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, ai grijă cu aia.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.77,0:22:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce e chestia aia?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.19,0:22:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, nu mă ignora. \NRăspunde-mi, puștoaico!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.90,0:22:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți voi împrumuta atelierul.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:58.73,0:23:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să-mi întăresc \Nmușchii. E în regulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:01.15,0:23:04.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă te va ajuta să-ți faci treaba, \Ncine sunt eu să zic nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.99,0:23:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ar trebui s-o oprești?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:10.04,0:23:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acea fată nu are nicio \Nșansă în fața lui Tommy J.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.58,0:23:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cherry e o păpușă mecanică.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:15.21,0:23:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fata aia are un corp Somadea?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:16.92,0:23:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Creierul ei e mai bătrân decât tine, \Nașa că ai grijă cum vorbești cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să spui?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.31,0:23:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poliția nu poate face nimic \Ndin moment ce v-am luat ostatici.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.78,0:23:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bun. Să continuăm cu spectacolul \N„Masacrul din tramvai”.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.32,0:23:49.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta e singurul vagon rămas.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.26,0:24:09.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să vedem de ce ești în stare, \N20.000 de ylla!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:09.93,0:24:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi voi omorî pe ostatici!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești invitatul meu. \NAcest lucru nu mă privește.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.98,0:24:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci ești un vânător de \Nrecompense, nu? Foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:18.98,0:24:19.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.07,0:24:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta a durut, nemernicule!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:32.83,0:24:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce pușlama enervantă.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:39.54,0:24:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vei nimeri nimic dacă \Nalergi și tragi, idiotule!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.13,0:24:50.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai două secunde să-ți \Nalegi ultimele cuvinte! Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.76,0:24:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tramvai nenorocit!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.27,0:24:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Copiii ar trebui să \Nînvețe să-și țină gura.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.23,0:25:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.02,0:25:02.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marș la școală!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:02.69,0:25:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.15,0:25:08.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde naiba țintești, tâmpitule?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:11.32,0:25:12.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rachete ghidate?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:21.79,0:25:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.64,0:25:39.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai lasă-mă!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:43.81,0:25:44.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:03.58,0:26:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fir-ar!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că... mi-am rupt ceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:30.69,0:26:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nenorocitule.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești doar un simplu om.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:35.45,0:26:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa și?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:37.03,0:26:42.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai nicio șansă împotriva unuia \Ncu un corp Somadea, puștiule!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:42.21,0:26:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă subestima, tâmpitule.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:45.33,0:26:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cel mai palpitant...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:47.71,0:26:49.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai lasă-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:49.21,0:26:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...e să arunc oameni în aer!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:56.18,0:27:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba?!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:03.18,0:27:03.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ea e...
Dialogue: 99,0:27:05.44,0:27:08.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă scuzați... Am venit să mă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:09.27,0:27:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde naiba ești? Arată-te, \Nvânătorule de recompense!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:14.40,0:27:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau să vă rog ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:16.45,0:27:21.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arăt cumva ca un preot? \NTe voi zdrobi ca pe un gândac.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:21.62,0:27:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am nevoie de bani.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:23.66,0:27:25.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă puteți auzi, domnule? \NAm nevoie de bani.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:25.96,0:27:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci mergi și \Nprostituează-te, târfo!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi lua recompensa \Npusă pe capul tău.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:44.56,0:27:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine naiba ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:46.60,0:27:49.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că acest corp are și avantaje.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uimitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.77,0:27:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum îndrăznești \Nsă-mi tai brațul drept?!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:17.26,0:28:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-am venit de hac?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:35.82,0:28:39.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că de la brâu în jos \Nești făcut din carne și oase.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:40.11,0:28:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog... Cruță-mi viața... Te implor!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:43.83,0:28:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-am spus, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:45.16,0:28:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am nevoie de bani.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:48.54,0:28:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bănuiesc că știi care e condiția \Npentru a primi recompensa.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:53.54,0:28:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Predarea către autorități a creierului \Ncriminalului cu modificări Somadea ce e căutat.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:57.92,0:29:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indiferent dacă e mort sau viu.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.02,0:29:15.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am nevoie doar de capul tău!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:37.26,0:29:40.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bună treabă!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.05,0:29:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În Arhimoarte...
Dialogue: 99,0:29:42.55,0:29:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,se naște o nouă eroină!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:45.31,0:29:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe cine numești tu „eroină”? \NHoața aia mică de ținte?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:52.35,0:29:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Au, au, au! Doare! Doare tare!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:53.35,0:29:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Costurile de reparare ale echipamentelor \Nvor fi deduse din partea ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:09.29,0:30:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt gata de acțiune!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:14.58,0:30:16.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci te-ai întors, colega cea nouă!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:17.55,0:30:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fetița mea drăguță iubește țigările.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:21.63,0:30:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ea pufăie din ele neîncetat.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:24.51,0:30:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îi tot spun să se oprească pentru că-i fac rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:28.64,0:30:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ea continuă să le pufăie.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:31.64,0:30:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se spune că fericirea,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:37.44,0:30:39.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,pică din albastrul cer îndepărtat.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:40.61,0:30:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar până voi cunoaște acea fericire.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:45.37,0:30:49.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi voi arunca țigările
Dialogue: 99,0:30:49.24,0:30:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,și voi continua să le pufăi.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:57.29,0:31:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ți-am lăsat banii pe hol, Cherry.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asigură-te că te speli bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:04.76,0:31:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:07.14,0:31:08.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce fetiță cuminte.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:12.23,0:31:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Data viitoare când vânezi, \Nnu-ți uita căscuța.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.14,0:31:15.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bucură-te cât încă mai poți.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:16.15,0:31:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zece mii de ylla.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:17.40,0:31:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zece mii de ylla. \NPoți păstra restul.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:19.27,0:31:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnișoară.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:21.44,0:31:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi avea mari probleme dacă se află \Ncă am vândut așa ceva unui minor.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:26.61,0:31:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt mai matură decât par.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:30.45,0:31:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci mi-l vinzi sau nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.87,0:31:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:34.75,0:31:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ascultă aici, fetițo...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.17,0:31:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă mai satur de ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:47.80,0:31:50.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc că mi-ai \Nscos-o în cale pe Cherry.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:50.81,0:31:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt atât de fericit!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:52.93,0:31:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe ploaie sau furtună. \NSunt mai fericit ca niciodată.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:56.56,0:31:58.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vom fi împreună pentru totdeauna!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:58.86,0:32:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cherry! Doamne! Îți mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:04.15,0:32:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E destul de greu.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:14.54,0:32:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eleganță.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:16.16,0:32:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Te voi ucide.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:03.88,0:33:06.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A venit momentul, Sherry.
